</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AA_zQQalrxYkKV9" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in"><span style="text-decoration: underline">S&amp;MI Ltd Acquisition</span></p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">On September 1, 2024, the
Company finalized an agreement for the acquisition of S&amp;MI, Ltd. (the &#8220;Share Purchase and Sale Agreement&#8221;), wherein
the Purchase Price was the total equivalent of One Million Dollars USD ($<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1_pp2d_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_zuQryJaoPKWl" title="Purchase price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember" id="Fact000891" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="2" unitRef="USD">1,000,000.00</ix:nonFraction></span>) in restricted stock units of common shares in
the Company (the &#8220;Payment-In-Kind&#8221;) fixed at Three Dollars USD ($<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionSharePrice_iI_pid_c20210630__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_zL4PVWjGKWH3" title="Shares price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionSharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2021-06-30_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember" id="Fact000893" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.00</ix:nonFraction></span>) per share (the &#8220;Fixed Price&#8221;). The
Purchase Price is to be paid out over five payments on the following schedule<i>: The</i> first payment of $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--FirstIssuanceDateMember_z4pAnO3sPKh1" title="Restricted common stock value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_FirstIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000895" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">150,000</ix:nonFraction></span> in restricted
common stock (<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--FirstIssuanceDateMember_z7fenliy8fzj" title="Restricted common stock shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_FirstIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000897" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">50,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares) of the Company is due and payable on September 1, 2024 (the &#8220;Completion Date&#8221; the
&#8220;First Issuance Date&#8221;). The remaining payments in restricted common stock to the shareholders of S&amp;MI Ltd. by the
Company will be made as follows: (i) a second payment of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--SecondIssuanceDateMember_z2mTcQhHs5Nd" title="Restricted common stock value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_SecondIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000899" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">212,500</ix:nonFraction></span> (<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--SecondIssuanceDateMember_zxQlBVuRbcF4" title="Restricted common stock shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_SecondIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000901" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">70,833</ix:nonFraction></span> shares) due on or before the 31<sup>st</sup> day following
ninety days after the Completion Date (the Second Issuance Date&#8221;); (ii) a third payment, of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--ThirdIssuanceDateMember_zM0hYfGWaXg" title="Restricted common stock value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_ThirdIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000903" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">212,500</ix:nonFraction></span> (<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--ThirdIssuanceDateMember_zgQKkDZd5LKi" title="Restricted common stock shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_ThirdIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000905" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">70,833</ix:nonFraction></span> shares) due on or
before the 31<sup>st</sup> day following ninety days after the Second Issuance Date (the Third Issuance Date&#8221;); (iii) a fourth
payment of $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--FourthIssuanceDateMember_zX6Dqkp3TsQl" title="Restricted common stock value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_FourthIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000907" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">212,500</ix:nonFraction></span> (<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--FourthIssuanceDateMember_zhQlvsK7nsqd" title="Restricted common stock shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_FourthIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000909" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">70,833</ix:nonFraction></span> shares) due on or before the 31<sup>st</sup> day following ninety days after the Third Issuance Date
(the &#8220;Fourth Issuance Date&#8221;); and (vi) a fifth and final payment of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--FifthIssuanceDateMember_zImPnyTvjm2f" title="Restricted common stock value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_FifthIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000911" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">212,500</ix:nonFraction></span> (<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--FifthIssuanceDateMember_zcZ2wB1E4glf" title="Restricted common stock shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_custom_SharePurchaseAndSaleAgreementMember_custom_FifthIssuanceDateMember" id="Fact000913" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">70,834</ix:nonFraction></span> shares) due on or before the
31<sup>st</sup> day following ninety days after the Fourth Issuance Date.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">In the event that the closing price of
the restricted stock units of common shares of the Company to be issued to the shareholders of S&amp;MI, Ltd. is lower than the Fixed
Purchase Price on the six (6) month anniversary of any issuance date of said shares (collectively the &#8220;Anniversary Issuance Price&#8221;),
then the Fixed Purchase Price shall be adjusted downward to the volume-weighted average price (&#8220;VWAP&#8221;) of the common stock
for the five (5) consecutive trading days immediately preceding the six (6) month anniversary date of said issuance date. Accordingly,
the Company shall be obligated to tender to the shareholders of S&amp;MI, Ltd. additional restricted common shares of the Company to make
up the difference between the Fixed Purchase Price and the Anniversary Issuance Price.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">The opening balance of S&amp;MI Ltd has
been included in our consolidated balance sheet since the date of the acquisition. Since the S&amp;MI Ltd&#8217;s financial statements
were denominated in British Pounds, the exchange rate of <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--PreferredStockDividendRatePerDollarAmount_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_z22vk2njkTDk" title="Preferred stock, dividend rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockDividendRatePerDollarAmount" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember" id="Fact000915" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">1.3141</ix:nonFraction></span> pounds per dollar was used to translate the balances.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; text-align: justify">The net purchase price was allocated to
the assets and liabilities acquired as per the table below. Goodwill represents the future economic benefits arising from other assets
acquired that could not be individually identified and separately recognized. The fair values of the acquired intangible assets were determined
using the valuation analysis performed by a third-party valuation firm.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; text-align: justify">The total purchase price of $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_zJ1fMPOqxVX3" title="Purchase price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember" id="Fact000917" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> consists of <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesAcquisitions_pid_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_zjGtsaIK3ifg" title="Number of shares issued for acquisition"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesAcquisitions" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember" id="Fact000919" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">333,333</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock at $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionSharePrice_iI_pid_c20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--GlobalGamingEnterprisesIncMember_zxN24WkfHI4" title="Shares price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionSharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2024-09-01_custom_GlobalGamingEnterprisesIncMember" id="Fact000921" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.00</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. The total consideration
transferred after net assets and assumption of long-term debt was approximately $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--PaymentsToAcquireBusinessesNetOfCashAcquired_c20240901__20240901__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_ztTLCanvvugl" title="Consideration transferred"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireBusinessesNetOfCashAcquired" contextRef="From2024-09-012024-09-01_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember" id="Fact000923" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">440,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, reflecting the purchase price, net of cash on
hand at S&amp;MI Ltd and the principal amount of certain loans assumed by the Company. The purchase price is for a <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20240901__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--GlobalGamingEnterprisesIncMember_zNO6BzoEfUwl" title="Ownership interest percent"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-09-01_custom_GlobalGamingEnterprisesIncMember23330000" id="Fact000925" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">100</ix:nonFraction></span>% ownership interest.
The purchase price was allocated to the identified tangible and intangible assets acquired based on their estimated fair values at the
acquisition date as follows:</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_custom_SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember" escape="true" id="Fact000927" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfBusinessAcquisitionsByAcquisitionTextBlock"><p id="xdx_892_eus-gaap--ScheduleOfBusinessAcquisitionsByAcquisitionTextBlock_hus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SAndMiLtdAcquisitionMember_zh46P0wOrgHi" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;&#160;<span id="xdx_8B7_zQkfpeiJ3YA8" style="display: none">Schedule of Identified Tangible and Intangible Asset Acquired</span></p>

